{
  "family": "states",
  "title": "状态随事件改变，每一段都能追踪",
  "subtitle": "明确的状态、转换与给定事件序列 · 虚构设备流程",
  "unit": "秒",
  "states": [
    {
      "id": "ready",
      "label": "就绪",
      "detail": "等待任务；尚未占用执行资源。"
    },
    {
      "id": "running",
      "label": "运行",
      "detail": "处理已经接受的任务。"
    },
    {
      "id": "paused",
      "label": "暂停",
      "detail": "保留进度，等待继续或撤销。"
    }
  ],
  "transitions": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "from": "ready",
      "to": "running",
      "label": "接受任务"
    },
    {
      "id": "pause",
      "from": "running",
      "to": "paused",
      "label": "收到暂停事件"
    },
    {
      "id": "resume",
      "from": "paused",
      "to": "running",
      "label": "收到继续事件"
    },
    {
      "id": "finish",
      "from": "running",
      "to": "ready",
      "label": "任务结束"
    },
    {
      "id": "cancel",
      "from": "paused",
      "to": "ready",
      "label": "撤销任务"
    }
  ],
  "trace": {
    "initial": "ready",
    "duration": 90,
    "events": [
      {
        "at": 10,
        "transition": "start"
      },
      {
        "at": 30,
        "transition": "pause"
      },
      {
        "at": 45,
        "transition": "resume"
      },
      {
        "at": 80,
        "transition": "finish"
      }
    ]
  },
  "note": "轨迹由给定转换事件推演，只有当前状态允许的转换才能接续；条件文字仅作说明，没有被当成程序执行。"
}